  "description": "A stillsuit is not luxury apparel. On Arrakis it is the difference between operating on the edge of thirst and never reaching the next ration stack at all.\n\nThe mod treats the suit as the foundation of open-sand survival. It does not grant immunity, but it stretches every water schedule, every work shift, and every trip away from shelter. Better quality and intact condition matter because the seal matters.",
